- Fixtures → valid XBEL: firefox3 (18 bookmarks/5 folders/3 separators), ie7 (13/4 incl `folded="true"`), opera9 (8/2); entities decoded, `&` escaped in hrefs
- `arora-cacheinfo` usage + URL query exit 0
- `arora-placesimport` on a synthetic `places.sqlite` wrote 3 visits into a fresh history store (first run appeared to write an empty file — that was correct `checkForExpired` pruning of my stale 2023 fixture dates)
- `./arora --quit-after-load`, `--nam-smoke`, `--history-smoke` PASS offscreen

